            "review_title": "Review at artisee HaDong",
            "review_text": "Carol R\nCongleton, United Kingdom13 contributions\n0\nGreat lunch !!!\nApr 2018 • Couples\nWe found this lovely cafe near to the cathedral. It was spotlessly clean ( which is why we entered), has helpful staff and also very clean toilets. It is set on several floors so has plenty of space and is air conditioned.\nThere is a great selection of cakes, paninis, salads and hot food as well as coffees.\nWe had a ham/cheese panini ,a chicken salad and two coffees all for under £10 ( 240,000 VND) and they were delicious.\nRead more\nWritten April 26, 2018\nArtisee V\nDear Carol R, \n\nThank you for sharing your feedback on tripadvisor. We also thank for your compliment on our products and shop! \n\nHowever, we are so sorry that we made you confused with different branch.\nThis listing, \"artisee HaDong\" is another branch from where you might enjoy our products.\nThe correct listing is \"artisee NhaTho\" where it locates near the cathedral. \n\nIt is still okay to leave your review here but it would be more helpful for us if you can make same review on our right listing \"artisee NhaTho\"\n\nHope you enjoyed the rest of your trip in Hanoi! \nThank you for always finding artisée. \n\nSincere Regards, Marketing Manager\nRead more\nWritten May 14, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
